msgstr "Buka Dataset Saya"

msgid "Go to Datasets"
msgstr "Buka Dataset"

msgid "RouteForge solves the Multi-Depot Vehicle Routing Problem for consumer product distribution — packed food and beverages — using three algorithms you can compare side by side."
msgstr "RouteForge menyelesaikan Multi-Depot Vehicle Routing Problem untuk distribusi produk konsumen — makanan dan minuman kemasan — menggunakan tiga algoritma yang dapat Anda bandingkan berdampingan."

msgid "Provide depots, customers, vehicles, items, and orders via a single XLSX file or five CSV files."
msgstr "Sediakan depot, pelanggan, kendaraan, item, dan pesanan melalui satu berkas XLSX atau lima berkas CSV."

msgid "Choose algorithms and tune parameters like population size, mutation rate, or MILP time limit, then start the run."
msgstr "Pilih algoritma dan atur parameter seperti ukuran populasi, laju mutasi, atau batas waktu MILP, lalu mulai proses."

msgid "Monitor each algorithm's progress in real time as it solves your routing problem."
msgstr "Pantau kemajuan setiap algoritma secara langsung saat menyelesaikan masalah perutean Anda."

msgid "Explore route maps, statistics, algorithm comparison charts, and export reports as PDF, CSV, or GeoJSON."
msgstr "Jelajahi peta rute, statistik, grafik perbandingan algoritma, dan ekspor laporan sebagai PDF, CSV, atau GeoJSON."

msgid "Hybrid Genetic Algorithm"
msgstr "Algoritma Genetika Hibrida"

msgid "Mixed-Integer Linear Programming"
msgstr "Pemrograman Linear Bilangan Bulat Campuran"

msgid "A fast constructive heuristic that builds routes by inserting the nearest feasible customer at each step. Serves as a quick baseline solution with minimal computation time."
msgstr "Heuristik konstruktif cepat yang membangun rute dengan menyisipkan pelanggan layak terdekat pada setiap langkah. Berfungsi sebagai solusi dasar cepat dengan waktu komputasi minimal."

msgid "Combines genetic algorithm operators (selection, crossover, mutation) with local search to balance solution quality and runtime. Effective for medium to large instances."
msgstr "Menggabungkan operator algoritma genetika (seleksi, crossover, mutasi) dengan pencarian lokal untuk menyeimbangkan kualitas solusi dan waktu proses. Efektif untuk instans sedang hingga besar."

msgid "A mathematical optimization model solved by Gurobi that guarantees optimal solutions. Best suited for small instances (up to 25 nodes) due to exponential complexity growth."
msgstr "Model optimasi matematis yang diselesaikan oleh Gurobi dan menjamin solusi optimal. Paling sesuai untuk instans kecil (hingga 25 node) karena pertumbuhan kompleksitas eksponensial."

msgid "RouteForge is an undergraduate thesis project investigating the Multi-Depot Vehicle Routing Problem (MDVRP) applied to the distribution of consumer products — specifically packed food and beverages."
msgstr "RouteForge adalah proyek skripsi sarjana yang meneliti Multi-Depot Vehicle Routing Problem (MDVRP) yang diterapkan pada distribusi produk konsumen — khususnya makanan dan minuman kemasan."

msgid "The problem scope includes:"
msgstr "Cakupan masalah meliputi:"

msgid "Multiple depots serving a shared fleet of vehicles"
msgstr "Beberapa depot yang melayani armada kendaraan bersama"

msgid "Vehicle capacity and maximum operational hour constraints"
msgstr "Kendala kapasitas kendaraan dan jam operasional maksimum"

msgid "Customer delivery time windows (deadline hours)"
msgstr "Jendela waktu pengiriman pelanggan (batas jam)"

msgid "Item expiry constraints for perishable goods"
msgstr "Kendala masa kedaluwarsa item untuk barang mudah rusak"

msgid "Comparison of three algorithms: Greedy, HGA, and MILP"
msgstr "Perbandingan tiga algoritma: Greedy, HGA, dan MILP"
